- `.agent_sources/github.com/alchemy-run/alchemy/website/src/content/docs/cloudflare/compute/workers.mdx`
- `.agent_sources/github.com/alchemy-run/alchemy/website/src/content/docs/cloudflare/apis/effect-http-api.mdx`
- `.agent_sources/github.com/Effect-TS/effect/packages/effect/src/unstable/http/HttpRouter.ts` (`toHttpEffect`, `add`, `layer`)
